---
// Customer Testimonials Section for Plombier Mons Urgent
// Real verified feedback from residential & commercial clients in Mons and Borinage
---

<section class="testimonials-section" id="avis-clients" aria-label="Témoignages clients vérifiés">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head text-center">
      <div class="section-badge">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-16">verified</span>
        <span>Avis Clients Authentiques & Vérifiés</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Ce que disent les habitants du Grand Mons</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Découvrez les retours d'expérience de particuliers, copropriétés et commerces locaux dépannés en urgence par nos artisans.
      </p>

      <div class="rating-summary-pill">
        <div class="stars-row">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-icon">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-icon">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-icon">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-icon">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-icon">star</span>
        </div>
        <span class="rating-text"><strong>4.9 / 5</strong> d'après 348 interventions enregistrées dans le Hainaut</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonials-grid">
      <!-- Testimonial 1: Mons Centre -->
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="card-top-meta">
          <div class="customer-profile">
            <div class="customer-avatar">
              <span>ED</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong class="customer-name">Émilie Dubois</strong>
              <span class="customer-location">Mons-Centre (7000) • Rue de Nimy</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="verified-tag">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-14">check_circle</span>
            <span>Client Vérifié</span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="stars-line">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="intervention-tag">Fuite d'eau nuit</span>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="testimonial-quote">
          "Fuite majeure sous l'évier de cuisine un vendredi soir à 22h30. J'ai appelé le numéro d'urgence, le plombier est arrivé en 18 minutes chrono. Réparation du raccord laiton effectuée immédiatement, sol protégé et facture conforme au forfait de garde annoncé. Un vrai soulagement !"
        </blockquote>

        <div class="card-footer-meta">
          <span class="intervention-date">Intervention : Octobre 2024</span>
          <span class="service-solved">Raccord d'alimentation cuivre</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 2: Jemappes -->
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="card-top-meta">
          <div class="customer-profile">
            <div class="customer-avatar">
              <span>BM</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong class="customer-name">Bernard Martin</strong>
              <span class="customer-location">Jemappes (7012) • Avenue Fénelon</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="verified-tag">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-14">check_circle</span>
            <span>Client Vérifié</span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="stars-line">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="intervention-tag">Débouchage haute pression</span>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="testimonial-quote">
          "Canalisation générale complètement bouchée avec refoulement dans le garage un dimanche matin. Ils sont intervenus avec leur camion hydrocureur. Inspection par caméra pour vérifier l'état des tuyaux après débouchage. Travail méticuleux et artisan très poli."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="card-footer-meta">
          <span class="intervention-date">Intervention : Septembre 2024</span>
          <span class="service-solved">Curage égout & caméra</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 3: Ghlin -->
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="card-top-meta">
          <div class="customer-profile">
            <div class="customer-avatar">
              <span>PV</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong class="customer-name">Philippe Vandamme</strong>
              <span class="customer-location">Ghlin (7011) • Route de Wallonie</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="verified-tag">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-14">check_circle</span>
            <span>Client Vérifié</span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="stars-line">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="intervention-tag">Dépannage chaudière</span>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="testimonial-quote">
          "Chaudière au gaz Bulex en sécurité avec code erreur F28 en pleine vague de froid. Le technicien agréé CERGA a diagnostiqué la sonde d'allumage défectueuse en 10 minutes. La pièce de rechange était stockée dans son utilitaire. Chauffage relancé le jour même."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="card-footer-meta">
          <span class="intervention-date">Intervention : Décembre 2024</span>
          <span class="service-solved">Attestation CERGA & PEB remise</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 4: Cuesmes -->
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="card-top-meta">
          <div class="customer-profile">
            <div class="customer-avatar">
              <span>CL</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong class="customer-name">Chantal Leclercq</strong>
              <span class="customer-location">Cuesmes (7033) • Rue du Peuple</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="verified-tag">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-14">check_circle</span>
            <span>Client Vérifié</span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="stars-line">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="intervention-tag">Recherche de fuite</span>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="testimonial-quote">
          "Infiltration d'eau inexpliquée dans le faux plafond de la buanderie. Recherche de fuite non destructive effectuée par caméra thermique sans rien casser. Rapport d'expertise complet transmis directement à mon assureur AXA qui a tout remboursé."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="card-footer-meta">
          <span class="intervention-date">Intervention : Novembre 2024</span>
          <span class="service-solved">Dossier assurance pris en charge</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 5: Nimy -->
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="card-top-meta">
          <div class="customer-profile">
            <div class="customer-avatar">
              <span>AG</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong class="customer-name">Alain Gérard</strong>
              <span class="customer-location">Nimy (7020) • Rue des Viaducs</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="verified-tag">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-14">check_circle</span>
            <span>Client Vérifié</span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="stars-line">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="intervention-tag">Chauffe-eau & Boiler</span>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="testimonial-quote">
          "Chauffe-eau électrique percé un samedi matin avec disjonction du tableau. Remplacement par un nouveau boiler Ariston haute efficacité le jour même. Raccordement sécurisé et évacuation des anciens équipements effectuée proprement."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="card-footer-meta">
          <span class="intervention-date">Intervention : Août 2024</span>
          <span class="service-solved">Garantie matériel 2 ans</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 6: Frameries -->
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="card-top-meta">
          <div class="customer-profile">
            <div class="customer-avatar">
              <span>SD</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong class="customer-name">Sophie Dupont</strong>
              <span class="customer-location">Frameries (7080) • Rue Joseph Dufrane</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="verified-tag">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon-14">check_circle</span>
            <span>Client Vérifié</span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="stars-line">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined star-mini">star</span>
          <span class="intervention-tag">Sanitaires & WC</span>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="testimonial-quote">
          "WC suspendu Geberit qui fuyait en continu dans la cuvette. Mécanisme de chasse d'eau et flotteur remplacés par des pièces neuves d'origine en 35 minutes. Prix transparent et technicien ponctuel. Je garde leur contact précieusement."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="card-footer-meta">
          <span class="intervention-date">Intervention : Juillet 2024</span>
          <span class="service-solved">Pièces Geberit d'origine</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Trust Action Bar -->
    <div class="testimonials-cta-box">
      <div class="cta-left">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined cta-shield">rate_review</span>
        <div>
          <strong class="cta-bold">Vous avez bénéficié d'une intervention à Mons ?</strong>
          <span class="cta-desc">Votre avis compte pour notre équipe familiale et guide les voisins de votre quartier.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-right">
        <a href="tel:0489164378" class="btn-primary">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">call</span>
          <span>Demander un Dépannage (0489 16 43 78)</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .testimonials-section {
    padding: 4.5rem 0;
    background-color: var(--surface-container-low);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--outline-variant);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--outline-variant);
  }

  .section-head {
    max-width: 740px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }

  .section-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--primary);
    background-color: rgba(0, 128, 128, 0.08);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.35rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--on-surface);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--on-surface-variant);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .rating-summary-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--outline-variant);
    padding: 0.45rem 1.15rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(16, 33, 58, 0.04);
  }

  .stars-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.1rem;
  }

  .star-icon {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #f59e0b;
  }

  .rating-text {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--on-surface);
  }

  /* Grid Layout */
  .testimonials-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .testimonial-card {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--outline-variant);
    border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
    padding: 1.65rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(16, 33, 58, 0.04);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.15rem;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .testimonial-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(16, 33, 58, 0.08);
  }

  .card-top-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .customer-profile {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .customer-avatar {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--secondary) 100%);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: var(--font-manrope);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .customer-name {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-manrope);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--on-surface);
  }

  .customer-location {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--on-surface-variant);
  }

  .verified-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #15803d;
    background-color: #f0fdf4;
    border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .stars-line {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .star-mini {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #f59e0b;
  }

  .intervention-tag {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    background-color: rgba(0, 128, 128, 0.08);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .testimonial-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-inter);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #334155;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    font-style: italic;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .card-footer-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-top: 0.85rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--outline-variant);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--on-surface-variant);
  }

  .service-solved {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  /* Bottom CTA Box */
  .testimonials-cta-box {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--outline-variant);
    border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(16, 33, 58, 0.05);
  }

  .cta-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-shield {
    font-size: 32px;
    color: var(--primary);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cta-bold {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-manrope);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--on-surface);
  }

  .cta-desc {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--on-surface-variant);
  }

  .icon-16 { font-size: 16px; }
  .icon-14 { font-size: 14px; }
</style>
